    source:
      id: GameStateMachine
      path: ''
      startLine: 11461
    summary: "\nGame State Machine manages game state transitions with proper event publishing\nEnsures TimeService and other systems receive correct state change notifications\n\nDesign: Uses dependency injection and factory pattern for state creation\nPros: Clean separation of concerns, proper event handling, extensible state creation\nCons: Requires all states to be registered in factory\n"
    example: []
    syntax:
      content:
        CSharp: 'public class GameStateMachine : IGameStateMachine'
        VB: >-
          Public Class GameStateMachine

              Implements IGameStateMachine
