  - id: GameFramework.UI.Popups.DebugPopup
    commentId: T:GameFramework.UI.Popups.DebugPopup
    language: CSharp
    name:
      CSharp: DebugPopup
      VB: DebugPopup
    nameWithType:
      CSharp: DebugPopup
      VB: DebugPopup
    qualifiedName:
      CSharp: GameFramework.UI.Popups.DebugPopup
      VB: GameFramework.UI.Popups.DebugPopup
    type: Class
    assemblies:
    - cs.temp.dll
    namespace: GameFramework.UI.Popups
    source:
      id: DebugPopup
      path: ''
      startLine: 14722
    summary: "\nEnhanced debug popup with real-time performance graphs\nDisplays FPS, memory consumption, and historical graphs of both metrics\n\nDesign:\n- Integrates custom GraphElement controls for visual data representation\n- Maintains separate data collection intervals for metrics vs graphs\n- Uses color-coded indicators for quick performance assessment\n- Efficient data sampling to prevent performance impact\n\nPros:\n- Visual trend analysis with historical graphs\n- Real-time performance monitoring with color coding\n- Memory efficient circular buffers for data storage\n- Configurable graph appearance and scaling\n- Clean separation between text metrics and visual graphs\n- Can be toggled on/off as overlay popup\n\nCons:\n- Increased memory usage for graph data storage\n- Additional rendering overhead for custom graph elements\n- More complex initialization and cleanup\n"
    example: []
    syntax:
      content:
        CSharp: 'public class DebugPopup : UIPopup'
        VB: >-
          Public Class DebugPopup

              Inherits UIPopup
